---
description: Used when starting to implement code from spec
alwaysApply: false
---

- New specs are written in ./docs/spec/**/<spec_name>.md
- You may only implement one spec at a time.
- You may only modify code in files specified in the spec.
- Start by writing the simplest possible implementation that satisfies the spec according to style.mdc.
- Refer to writing_tests.mdc for writing the tests afterwards.
- Edit any architecture or design decision in ./docs/architecture directory
- Each spec contains the interface of the code to be implemented, including types and parameters, do not add any additional public methods or attributes.